{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":11,"ref":"job 42:11","book":"job","lang":"tw","chapter":42,"translation":"Na ne nuanom nyinaa, ne ne nua mmea nyinaa, ne wɔn a na wɔnim no dada nyinaa baa ne nkyɛn; na wɔdii aduane ne no wɔ ne fi; na wɔtutuu wɔn ti maa no, na wɔhyɛɛ no nkɔmmɔden ⟨אתו⟩ wɔ ɔhaw nyinaa a Yawe de bae ne so; na wɔmaa no: onipa biara kesitah baako, ne onipa biara nsɔnua a ɛyɛ sikakɔkɔɔ baako.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויבאו","gloss":"baa"},{"surface":"אליו","gloss":"ne nkyɛn"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"nyinaa"},{"surface":"אחיו","gloss":"ne nuanom"},{"surface":"וכל","gloss":"ne ... nyinaa"},{"surface":"אחיתיו","gloss":"ne nua mmea"},{"surface":"וכל","gloss":"ne ... nyinaa"},{"surface":"ידעיו","gloss":"wɔn a na wɔnim no"},{"surface":"לפנים","gloss":"dada"},{"surface":"ויאכלו","gloss":"wɔdii aduane"},{"surface":"עמו","gloss":"ne no"},{"surface":"לחם","gloss":"aduane"},{"surface":"בביתו","gloss":"wɔ ne fi"},{"surface":"וינדו","gloss":"wɔtutuu wɔn ti"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"maa no"},{"surface":"וינחמו","gloss":"wɔhyɛɛ no nkɔmmɔden"},{"surface":"אתו","gloss":"⟨אתו⟩","marks":"no"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"wɔ"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"nyinaa"},{"surface":"הרעה","gloss":"ɔhaw"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"a"},{"surface":"הביא","gloss":"de bae"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yawe"},{"surface":"עליו","gloss":"ne so"},{"surface":"ויתנו","gloss":"wɔmaa"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"no"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"onipa biara"},{"surface":"קשיטה","gloss":"kesitah"},{"surface":"אחת","gloss":"baako"},{"surface":"ואיש","gloss":"ne onipa biara"},{"surface":"נזם","gloss":"nsɔnua"},{"surface":"זהב","gloss":"sikakɔkɔɔ"},{"surface":"אחד","gloss":"baako"}],"timestamp":"2026-09-16T03:42:05.076100150Z","model":"glm-5.3"}